(248, NULL, NULL, 'AIN Changes', '2026-05-26', '2026-05-26', 'Medium', 'Completed', 12, 8, '<div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"0.6666666666666666\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid rgb(56, 88, 249); padding-left: 20px;\"><p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">• ADD BLOG URL FIELD </span>— <span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: rgb(56, 88, 249);\">40m</span></p><ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><li data-section-id=\"v0tcgn\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"82\">Added <span data-start=\"8\" data-end=\"20\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Blog URL</span> field in the <span data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"46\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Add Blog</span> form, same as the Edit Blog form.</li><li data-section-id=\"circ1x\" data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"161\">Updated blog validation to require the <span data-start=\"124\" data-end=\"136\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Blog URL</span> while creating a blog.</li><li data-section-id=\"2d2jtw\" data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"245\">Updated blog slug generation to use the <span data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"216\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Blog URL</span> instead of the Blog Title.</li><li data-section-id=\"bm37ch\" data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"328\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Updated edit blog logic so the slug is also updated from the <span data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"321\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Blog URL</span> field.</li></ol></div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px; border-width: 2px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(241, 245, 249) rgb(145, 161, 182) rgb(145, 161, 182);\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"1.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid rgb(56, 88, 249); padding-left: 20px;\"><p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">• CLIENT BEHAVIOUR FUNCTIONALITY</span> — <span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: rgb(56, 88, 249);\">1h 30m</span></p><ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><li data-section-id=\"15bf10n\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"90\">Added <span data-start=\"8\" data-end=\"34\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">B button functionality</span> to open the Client Behaviour modal from the order list.</li><li data-section-id=\"1952x6i\" data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"227\">Created a separate <span data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"134\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">client_behaviours</span> table flow so every new behaviour entry is saved separately instead of updating the old one.</li><li data-section-id=\"cgytev\" data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"338\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Added functionality to show the user’s <span data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"290\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">latest behaviour</span> inside the modal before adding a new behaviour.</li></ol></div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px; border-width: 2px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(241, 245, 249) rgb(145, 161, 182) rgb(145, 161, 182);\">', NULL, '2026-05-26 09:14:26', '2026-05-29 12:31:18', '2026-05-29 12:31:18'),
