ata-start=\"571\" data-end=\"697\">\r\nAdded author name display on blog detail page using author id from the blog table and author data from the author table.</li><li data-section-id=\"1bmj7fb\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"697\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 0.84rem;\">PrimeAssignment</span>&nbsp;<br></li><li data-section-id=\"rjyros\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"94\">Worked on the PrimeAssignment WordPress website built with the Seoes Marketing Agency theme.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1luz5m2\" data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"134\">\r\nReviewed blog content styling issues.</li><li data-section-id=\"1luz5m2\" data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"134\">Added responsive CSS improvements for better mobile view.</li>', NULL, '2026-05-27 12:48:09', '2026-05-29 12:49:03', '2026-05-29 12:49:03'),
