(51, 96, NULL, '<div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"8\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• WHOLE CODE CONVERTED IN LARAVEL AND FIXED THE HOME PAGE AND FULL PAGE ARE ASLO RESPONSVE IN ALL SCREEN SIZES</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">8h</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li data-section-id=\"14c11qd\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"189\">Completed the full HTML to Laravel Blade conversion and successfully implemented all sections into the WTS Home Page with proper reusable component structure and clean code management.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k99rut\" data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"369\">\r\nIntegrated all Home Page sections with the existing Laravel project architecture and optimized the overall layout structure for smooth performance and easier future updates.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3wz7cf\" data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"539\">\r\nFinished responsive design implementation for desktop, tablet, and mobile views while fixing spacing, alignment, and UI consistency issues across all screen sizes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utce2b\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"706\">\r\nAdded animations, hover effects, and smooth transitions in multiple sections to improve the overall user experience and make the Home Page visually interactive.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"px8ljr\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"878\">\r\nFixed remaining UI and section-related issues, optimized component rendering, and ensured all Home Page content and layouts are displaying properly without breaking.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"flny7\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1090\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nCompleted final testing of the WTS Home Page, verified section responsiveness and functionality, and confirmed that all major development work is now fully completed with only minor future changes remaining.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\">', 'Ranjit Singh Shaktawat', '8.00', NULL, '2026-05-22 12:19:30', '2026-05-22 12:19:30'),
(52, 119, NULL, '<div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"3\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• TEST API OF CAN REG , CAN MD</strong>— <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">3h</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>Can Reg API not working from our side test api with provided UAT data (multple data)</li><li>save proper can data in user table</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\">', 'ANSHUL SUTHAR (KHETA RAM)', '3.00', NULL, '2026-05-22 12:23:36', '2026-05-22 12:23:36'),
