th <span data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"130\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">role_id = 1</span> can view the revenue data.</li><li data-section-id=\"fynvmt\" data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"222\">Hid the <span data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"194\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">order-summary-footer</span> from all non-admin users.</li><li data-section-id=\"1x6efmw\" data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"274\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Ensured other order list logic remains unchanged.</li></ol></div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px; border-width: 2px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(241, 245, 249) rgb(145, 161, 182) rgb(145, 161, 182);\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"1.6666666666666665\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid rgb(56, 88, 249); padding-left: 20px;\"><p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">• ADD POPUP ON BREAK</span> — <span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: rgb(56, 88, 249);\">1h 40m</span></p><ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><li data-section-id=\"lf05j0\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"66\">Added a full-screen break popup for Lunch Break and Tea Break.</li><li data-section-id=\"1y88mzn\" data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"146\">Blocked the screen while the employee is on break until the break is ended.</li><li data-section-id=\"1vcc3xe\" data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"211\">Added an “End Break” button inside the popup to resume work.</li><li data-section-id=\"1t29n35\" data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"311\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Implemented multi-tab synchronization so the break popup appears on all open tabs simultaneously.</li></ol></div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px; border-width: 2px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(241, 245, 249) rgb(145, 161, 182) rgb(145, 161, 182);\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"1\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid rgb(56, 88, 249); padding-left: 20px;\"><p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">• HOT WARM COLD IS NOT WORKING IN LEAD </span>— <span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: rgb(56, 88, 249);\">1h</span></p><ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><li data-section-id=\"151endi\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"54\">Fixed the lead sorting issue based on star status.</li><li data-section-id=\"1u725ks\" data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"116\">Updated the logic so <span data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"100\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">3-star / Hot leads</span> appear first.</li><li data-section-id=\"z3v2nm\" data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"175\">Set <span data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"146\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">2-star / Warm leads</span> to appear after Hot leads.</li><li data-section-id=\"1hobqx2\" data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"233\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Set <span data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"205\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">1-star / Cold leads</span> to appear after Warm leads.</li></ol></div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px; border-width: 2px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(241, 245, 249) rgb(145, 161, 182) rgb(145, 161, 182);\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"0.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid rgb(56, 88, 249); padding-left: 20px;\"><p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">• ADD LEAD COUNT </span>— <span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: rgb(56, 88, 249);\">30m</span></p><ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><li data-section-id=\"50i4r2\" data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"88\">Added <span data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"51\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Lead Count</span> near the user name in the Lead list.</li><li data-section-id=\"z98i52\" data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"167\">Replaced the previous <span data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"129\" style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Order Count</span> with total leads linked to that user.</li><li data-section-id=\"5ap28h\" data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"231\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Displayed the lead count using a badge for quick visibility.</li></ol></div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px; border-width: 2px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(241, 245, 249) rgb(145, 161, 182) rgb(145, 161, 182);\">', 'Rahul Sharma', '8.83', NULL, '2026-05-25 05:18:08', '2026-05-25 05:18:08');
INSERT INTO `task_follow_ups` (`id`, `daily_task_id`, `project_id`, `work_description`, `reference_name`, `time_taken`, `photo`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(102, 201, NULL, '<div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"0.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• IMAGES UNDER PUBLIC WAS NOT WORKING</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">30m</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>&nbsp;Updated Laravel Blade image handling to use <code data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1070\">{{ asset() }}</code> instead of direct static paths for environment-safe asset loading.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"0.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• CORRECTED THE DATABASE WITH MISSING TABLES AND LATEST BLOG DATA, AND MAKE IT LIVE TO THE SERVER</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">30m</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>&nbsp;Prepared SQL queries to check missing tables/columns and create the required pivot table directly from phpMyAdmin.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"2\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• ERROR RESOLVED WHEN CHANGING THE API URL TO CRM.WARR, SERVICE PAGES WAS NOT WORKING</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">2h</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>&nbsp;Debugged Next.js Server Component error caused by using <code data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"421\">onClick</code> inside a server-rendered page and separated interactive logic into a client-side approach.</li><li>Added detailed API debugging logs in Next.js service page fetch function to trace response status, raw API output, and JSON parsing issues.</li><li>Identified Laravel production API failure caused by missing database pivot table <code data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"771\">warr_service_page_more_services</code>.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"0.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• UPDATED BLOG IMAGES IN PUBLIC FOLDER AND STORAGE FOLDER</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">30m</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>&nbsp;Configured <code data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"168\">.gitignore</code> to allow tracking of <code data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"210\">storage/app/public</code> while keeping Laravel cache/log folders ignored.</li><li>Resolved Git tracking issue for storage images using force add and cache clearing commands.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\"><div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"1\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• SETUP AND FIX ISSUE </strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">1h</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>&nbsp;Fixed Composer installation issue in this project by identifying corrupted <code data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"88\">vendor</code> setup and troubleshooting autoload generation errors.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\">', 'Jay Sahu', '4.50', NULL, '2026-05-25 09:30:53', '2026-05-25 09:30:53'),
(103, 201, NULL, '<div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"0.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• CHANGED THE BLOG MODULE TO SHOW ONLY WARRGYIZMORSCH BLOGS</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">30m</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>&nbsp;Now only warrgyizmorsch blog will be visible and there is no option of selecting wts blogs, none from the filter.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\">', 'Jay Sahu', '0.50', NULL, '2026-05-25 09:33:14', '2026-05-25 09:33:14'),
(104, 192, NULL, '<div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"0.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• REMOVED MANY FRONTEND ROUTES</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">30m</b></p>\r\n                                                            <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n                                                                <li>&nbsp;Redirect the project to the /login page when \'/\' route hits.</li><li>Removed unnecessary frontend routes from web.php.</li>\r\n                                                            </ol>\r\n                                                          </div><hr class=\"sub-task-hr\" style=\"border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9; margin: 20px 0;\">', 'Jay Sahu', '0.50', NULL, '2026-05-25 09:35:47', '2026-05-25 09:35:47'),
(105, 197, NULL, '<ol class=\"ol1\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><ol class=\"ol1\"><li class=\"li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Fixed the Table UI</li><li class=\"li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Fixed the Top Bar UI</li><li class=\"li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Fixed the Payment option UI</li></ol></ol>', 'Mangilal Gadri', '0.00', NULL, '2026-05-25 11:16:53', '2026-05-25 11:16:53'),
(106, 198, NULL, '<ol class=\"ol1\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><ol class=\"ol1\"><li class=\"li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Fixed the Table UI</li><li class=\"li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Fixed the Date Section</li><li class=\"li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Fixed the Valuation Section UI</li></ol></ol>', 'Mangilal Gadri', '0.00', NULL, '2026-05-25 11:17:45', '2026-05-25 11:17:45'),
(107, 190, NULL, '<div class=\"sub-task-item mb-4\" data-time=\"4.5\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #3858f9; padding-left: 20px;\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b;\"><strong>• DESKTOP UI DONE</strong> — <b style=\"color: #3858f9;\">4h 30m</b><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><li><div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:0b4f1bac-582d-4969-9779-61110bbe8e55-6\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0b4f1bac-582d-4969-9779-61110bbe8e55-6\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:0b4f1bac-582d-4969-9779-61110bbe8e55-6\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-14\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"5404e350-5e47-4fd9-99db-25a0c9a3d5fe\