nt-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Enhance the format of CSV, exel pdf and print check in the reports page<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Enhance the format of the barcode print on the barcode page<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li></ol></ol>', 'Mangilal Gadri', '0.00', NULL, '2026-05-25 11:18:20', '2026-05-25 11:18:20'),
