(258, 337, 60, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN AI DEVELOPMENT</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Task Report — May 30, 2026</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Upgraded chatbot architecture from HTTP (REST) to WebSockets</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Enabled real-time, bi-directional communication for faster interactions</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Improved responsiveness and user experience</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented WebSocket Connection Manager</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Added support for handling multiple concurrent users</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Improved connection and session management</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added session tracking system</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Implemented unique session IDs for each user</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Prevented chat mix-ups and improved conversation isolation</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed Agent Support Dashboard</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Created custom CRM-style dashboard for support agents</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Added real-time active user monitoring and chat visibility</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented Human Handoff (Takeover Feature)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Enabled agents to take over conversations from AI when required</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Allowed seamless transition between AI and human support</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'love kumar todawat', '8', NULL, '2026-06-01 11:02:10', '2026-06-01 11:02:10'),
(259, 336, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 1h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added and configured SEO meta tags in the main app.blade.php layout file.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented canonical URL tags to improve search engine indexing and prevent duplicate content issues.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added hreflang (en-gb) tags for proper language and regional targeting of UK users.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Configured Twitter Card meta tags including title, description, image, URL, site handle, and creator handle for enhanced social media sharing.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added Open Graph (OG) meta tags including title, description, URL, image, and website type for improved Facebook and social platform previews.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Updated robots meta directives to allow search engine indexing and crawling (index, follow).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Standardized homepage SEO metadata to improve visibility and social sharing appearance across search engines and social media platforms.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed and optimized social media link attributes for SEO best practices.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Performed website SEO configuration testing and validation for metadata implementation.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">ADD robots.txt file</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '1', NULL, '2026-06-01 11:15:24', '2026-06-01 11:15:24'),
(260, 336, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 0h 40m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed all social media links across the website footer and key sections.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added rel=&quot;nofollow&quot; attribute to external social media links including Facebook, Instagram, X (Twitter), Pinterest, and YouTube.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; attributes to improve security and prevent external page access to the parent window.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Configured external social media links to open in a new tab using target=&quot;_blank&quot;.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed external review platform links (Google Reviews and Trustpilot) and applied nofollow attributes where required.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Ensured internal website links (such as the Reviews page) remain follow links to preserve internal SEO value and link equity.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Verified implementation to align with SEO best practices and search engine crawling guidelines.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '0.66666666666667', NULL, '2026-06-01 11:15:24', '2026-06-01 11:15:24'),
(261, 336, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 3h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed the &quot;Get 100% Original Assignments&quot; button functionality on the Free Samples page and connected it with the assignment quote popup modal.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Created and integrated a custom assignment quote popup while maintaining the existing form logic and validation process.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Designed and optimized the popup UI with promotional content, CTA elements, and responsive layout improvements.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Enhanced the Review section by adding a dynamic writer profile card with database-driven content.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Integrated dynamic writer information including profile image, writer name, completed orders, in-progress orders, ratings, and profile details.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added functional CTA buttons such as &quot;Hire Writer&quot; and &quot;Order Now&quot; with proper navigation and popup triggers.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved the Review section layout and overall user experience to increase engagement and conversion opportunities.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Performed UI refinements and responsive design adjustments for both the Free Samples page and Review section components.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Tested popup functionality, dynamic data rendering, and button actions across desktop and mob