(289, 366, 33, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Saas ERP</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 7h 40m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Tested the Inventory Management module in the SaaS ERP project and identified multiple functional and UI issues.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Organized and restructured routes and menu groups for better maintainability and access control.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added permissions for newly created routes and menus to ensure proper role-based access.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Resolved JavaScript issues across multiple pages that were caused by application layout conflicts.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed accordion functionality issues that were preventing users from adding Projects and Inventory records.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Resolved dropdown visibility issues throughout the Inventory Management module.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed API integration issues where machine and project selection was not triggering API calls due to incorrect URL configurations.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented a Role Authority Level system across the SaaS ERP project to establish hierarchical role management and prevent privilege escalation.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Pushed the Authority Level implementation to a separate branch for testing and review.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Compared and synchronized features between the Inventory Management project and the SaaS ERP Inventory module.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Migrated and integrated additional Inventory Management features into the SaaS ERP project where applicable.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Jay Sahu', '7.6666666666667', NULL, '2026-06-01 12:44:21', '2026-06-01 12:44:21'),
