(323, 382, 53, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Other (Development)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Work Report – 02 June 2026</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Pithal Project:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed the complete Blog Page UI and integrated required images and assets.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added and updated images on the Career Page along with related UI improvements.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Made UI enhancements and added images to the Contact Us Page.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Refactored and optimized frontend components by improving icons, typography, spacing, card layouts, and overall visual consistency.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented a bottom popup strip with close functionality and enhanced user interaction elements.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Organized and optimized project assets, including career and contact page images, for better maintainability and performance.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Nikhil Sharma', '8', NULL, '2026-06-02 12:21:32', '2026-06-02 12:21:32'),
(324, 378, 15, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; WTS Frontend</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Designed and developed a completely new Footer UI with improved structure, better content organization, and enhanced navigation for a seamless user experience across the website.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added and properly aligned all footer components, including quick links, contact details, social media icons, and important sections while maintaining full responsiveness on all devices.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Integrated Hero Section images across all Country Pages with proper positioning, responsive behavior, and optimized display for better visual presentation.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added and configured Sub Hero Section images for all Country Pages to support country-specific content and improve overall page aesthetics.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Optimized all Hero and Sub Hero images for faster loading speed, improved performance, and consistent responsiveness on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Resolved all pending Service Page issues, including UI fixes, layout corrections, responsiveness improvements, and content alignment adjustments.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Ensured all newly added Footer components, Country Page sections, and Service Page updates follow the existing design system for a consistent user experience throughout the website.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Performed complete testing and refinement of Footer, Country Pages, and Service Pages to fix alignment issues, spacing inconsistencies, responsiveness problems, and overall UI-related bugs.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Ranjit Singh Shaktawat', '8', NULL, '2026-06-02 12:22:14', '2026-06-02 12:22:14'),
