(337, 394, 33, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Saas ERP</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented the Project Stage Module from the Inventory Management project into the SaaS ERP Inventory Module.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Synchronized all the latest updates and enhancements from the Inventory Management project to the SaaS ERP Inventory Module and resolved related issues.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Worked on tenant-based data isolation across modules including Leads, Projects, Inventories, and other business data. Previously, data changes were shared across all tenants; now each tenant maintains its own isolated data environment.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved the CRM sidebar UI and theme for a better user experience and visual consistency.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added the POS (Point of Sale) Module to the SaaS ERP project.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Deployed the latest project version to the live server and completed database synchronization to ensure all modules and data structures are up to date.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Jay Sahu', '8', NULL, '2026-06-02 12:46:48', '2026-06-02 12:46:48'),
(338, 392, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 1h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed the User Retention Report module with year-wise monthly cohort analysis.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented New User tracking based on user registration month.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added Retain User logic to identify users who placed orders after the defined retention period.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added Not Retain User logic to identify users who did not place any orders within the retention window.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Created separate detailed lists for New Users, Retain Users, and Not Retain Users for each month.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented user search functionality using Name, Email, and Mobile Number filters.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added calculation and display of Retention Percentage (%) and Not Retention Percentage (%) month-wise.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Optimized database queries using joins and subqueries to improve report performance.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added yearly filtering to analyze retention data for any selected year.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Enhanced report accuracy by ensuring Retain and Not Retain users are calculated only from the corresponding month&#039;s New User cohort.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved report UI and data presentation for better analysis and decision-making.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '1', NULL, '2026-06-02 12:49:32', '2026-06-02 12:49:32'),
(339, 392, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 2h 20m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added Payment Revoke functionality with confirmation popup before revoking a payment.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented revoke comment field to capture the reason for payment revocation.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added database support to store revoke status, revoke comment, revoked date, and revoked user details.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Updated payment logic to automatically recalculate and update the received amount after a payment is revoked.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Created a separate Revoked Payments List page to track all revoked payments.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Designed the Revoked Payments page with a layout similar to the Order List for consistency.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added payment filtering support on the Revoked Payments page.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Separated payment filters from order filters to avoid conflicts between Payment List and Order List.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented dedicated routes and controller methods for Revoked Payment filtering.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added retention of filter values using separate local storage keys for Payment and Order modules.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Removed unnecessary Order-specific quick filters (Team Alpha, Team Giga, Overdue, Today&#039;s Deadline, Writer&#039;s Deadline, Writer Query, Hold Work) from the Revoked Payments page.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved payment management workflow by providing complete visibility of active and revoked transactions.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '2.3333333333333', NULL, '2026-06-02 12:49:32', '2026-06-02 12:49:32'),
(340, 392, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 2h 50m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed a new Delivery Follow-Up Report to track follow-up activities for delivered orders.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented month-wise user statistics based on order delivery data.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added Total Users and Follow-Up Users counts using order and follow-up information.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Integrated follow-up status tracking including:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Negative But Convinced</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Negative</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Positive</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Positive &amp; Referral</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Positive &amp; Own Order</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">No Response</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added clickable count functionality to view detailed user lists for each category.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented user-wise details view including Order ID, Follow-Up Status, Follow-Up Comment, Follow-Up By, and Follow-Up Date.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added custom date filtering support for generating reports within a selected date range.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Updated report sorting logic to display orders based on Delivery Date priority (latest delivery dates shown first).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved report UI with expandable sections and scrollable user lists for better usability and performance.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '2.8333333333333', NULL, '2026-06-02 12:49:32', '2026-06-02 12:49:32'),
(341, 392, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 2h 30m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added a dedicated filter system for the Revoked Payments List.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Separated Revoked Payment filters from the existing Order filters to prevent data conflicts.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented a separate filter route and controller logic for Revoked Payments.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added support for filtering revoked payments by Order ID, User, Status, Writer, College, Module Code, Paper Type, Semester, Team, Offer, and Date Range.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed filter count issues by displaying the actual revoked payment count instead of the order count.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Updated filter title dynamically to show &quot;Filtered Revoked Payments&quot; instead of &quot;Filtered Orders&quot;.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added separate local storage keys for Order filters and Revoked Payment filters to prevent filter data overlap between modules.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Ensured filters applied on the Revoked Payments page do not affect the Order List page and vice versa.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Removed unnecessary Order-specific quick filters from the Revoked Payments page, including:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Team Alpha</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Team Giga</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Overdue</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Today&#039;s Deadline</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Writer&#039;s Deadline</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Writer Query</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Hold Work</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved filter behavior and UI consistency across Payment and Revoked Payment modules.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Modified the report logic to display records delivery date-wise instead of user-wise grouping.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Removed user-based grouping so that each delivered order appears individually in the report.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Updated sorting to show today&#039;s delivery date orders at the top, followed by yesterday&#039;s orders and then older delivery dates.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Retained the existing feedback status priority logic, ensuring pending/no feedback orders appear before completed feedback orders.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Preserved all existing filters including:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Feedback Status</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Order Date Range</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Delivery Date Range</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Maintained pagination and report structure without affecting existing functionality.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved report visibility by prioritizing orders that require immediate follow-up based on their delivery date.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Ensured completed feedback records continue to appear below pending feedback records while still following delivery date sorting.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '2.5', NULL, '2026-06-02 12:49:32', '2026-06-02 12:49:32'),
