(367, 420, 53, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Other (Development)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 4h 30m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Attended a Prompt Engineering Seminar to gain a deeper understanding of effective prompt design techniques and AI interaction best practices.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Learned various prompt structuring methods, including role-based prompting, context management, and instruction optimization for improved AI-generated results.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Explored advanced prompt engineering concepts to enhance content generation, problem-solving, and workflow automation capabilities.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Analyzed real-world use cases and practical examples to understand how well-crafted prompts can improve response accuracy and efficiency.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Gained insights into AI communication strategies, prompt refinement techniques, and methods for achieving more consistent and relevant outputs.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Participated in discussions and knowledge-sharing sessions focused on the latest trends, tools, and applications of Prompt Engineering in different industries.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Ranjit Singh Shaktawat', '4.5', NULL, '2026-06-03 12:32:16', '2026-06-03 12:32:16'),
