(478, 508, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 7h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented submenu-level permission handling in the User Rights module to ensure users can access only the assigned submenus instead of all submenus under a parent menu.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Updated sidebar permission logic to display menus and submenus based on role-specific permissions.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Modified role-based access conditions to allow visibility for Role IDs 1, 4, and 9 where required.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved the &quot;Other&quot; column UI in the Order List by restructuring the display of Convert By and Failed By details for better readability.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Enhanced the Client Marks feature:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Display assigned marks instead of the default &quot;M&quot; button when marks are already available.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Enabled editing of existing marks by opening the same modal on marks click.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Ensured the latest selected marks are automatically shown in the modal.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added automatic page refresh after saving marks to reflect updated values instantly.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed and updated filter module behavior to support a collapsible filter section, allowing filters to remain hidden by default and expand on user interaction.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Performed testing and validation of permission, marks management, and filter functionality to ensure existing workflows remain unaffected.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '7', NULL, '2026-06-05 12:55:38', '2026-06-05 12:55:38'),
