(483, 513, 15, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; WTS Frontend</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 7h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Designed and developed a new EMI Calculator Page with a responsive layout, intuitive user interface, and accurate EMI calculation functionality.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Integrated loan calculation features, allowing users to calculate monthly installments based on loan amount, interest rate, and repayment tenure.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented and fixed various SEO-related improvements, including metadata updates, page optimization, and technical SEO enhancements to improve search engine performance.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved the responsiveness of the Subject Page, ensuring proper content alignment and seamless user experience across all screen sizes.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Optimized the About Us Page responsiveness by fixing layout, spacing, and content display issues for mobile and tablet devices.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Resolved responsiveness and UI issues on the Contact Us Page, ensuring better form alignment and improved usability.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Applied multiple updates and fixes on the Home Page, including layout refinements, content adjustments, and design consistency improvements.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Configured and corrected button redirections across different sections of the website, ensuring users are directed to the appropriate pages.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed various UI and navigation issues to improve overall website functionality and user experience.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Performed comprehensive testing of all implemented changes, including responsiveness checks, navigation flow verification, button functionality, EMI calculator accuracy, and SEO updates to ensure smooth performance across the website.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Ranjit Singh Shaktawat', '7', NULL, '2026-06-06 11:27:23', '2026-06-06 11:27:23'),
