(492, 516, 53, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Other (Development)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 7h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Real Estate Project -</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Task Report - Today</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 3: Implemented Authentication &amp; Authorization system using NextAuth, role-based access control, protected routes, login/logout functionality, and admin access management.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 4: Developed Admin Panel Foundation including dashboard layout, sidebar navigation, top navbar, reusable components, statistics cards, and responsive admin structure.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 5: Built Category Management module with complete CRUD operations, validation, search, pagination, soft delete, restore functionality, and slug management.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 6: Developed Location Management system (Country, State, City) with hierarchical CRUD operations, validations, dependent dropdowns, search, and soft delete support.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 7: Implemented Property Management module with complete property CRUD operations, filters, status management, featured property functionality, search, pagination, and property administration features.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 8: Integrated Property Image Management with Cloudinary, including multiple image uploads, featured image selection, image gallery management, image sorting, and deletion functionality.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 9: Built Enquiry Management &amp; Lead Tracking system with enquiry listing, status management, lead workflow, filters, search, statistics, and admin lead monitoring.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 10: Developed Frontend Homepage with dynamic property data, hero section, featured properties, latest properties, category sections, location sections, statistics, and responsive design.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 11: Implemented Property Listing Page with advanced search, filters, sorting, pagination, SEO-friendly URLs, and responsive property browsing experience.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 12: Developed Property Detail Page with image gallery, property overview, specifications, location details, related properties, contact information, and structured SEO support.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 13: Integrated Public Enquiry &amp; Lead Capture system including property enquiry forms, WhatsApp integration, contact actions, email notifications, validation, and database integration.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed Phase 14: Implemented advanced SEO Infrastructure including dynamic metadata, admin-managed SEO settings, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, Open Graph tags, Twitter Cards, structured data (JSON-LD), canonical URLs, and SEO management for homepage, property listings, and property details.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Conducted project architecture review and planned next-phase UI/UX improvements, performance optimization, security hardening, monitoring, and production deployment strategy.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Jay Sahu', '7', NULL, '2026-06-06 11:51:01', '2026-06-06 11:51:01'),
(493, 517, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h 30m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">1. Lead List Layout Integration in Source Report</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Task Description: Replaced the legacy, basic summary table layout in the Source Lead Report with the advanced, full-featured Lead List UI layout.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented Columns &amp; Components: Maintained design and behavioral consistency by integrating all core columns:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Sr. No., Action Components (Checkboxes, Switches, Edit triggers, Duplicate handlers, Reason selectors), Dynamic Comment Box, Order ID with custom failure background states, Client Name with historical loyalty badges, Order Date, Project Title (including Semester/Technical tags), Words count, Price, and Delivery Date.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">2. Dynamic Status Navigation &amp; Filters Implementation</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Task Description: Implemented a smooth, horizontally scrollable status navigation bar at the top of the report view.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Status Tabs Configured: Developed tabs for All, Hot, Cold, Warm, Price, Deadline, Serious Concern, Marks, Quality, Customer Service, and Unknown.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Real-time Count Badge System: Embedded dynamic numeric badges onto each status tab that automatically sync and recalculate based on the active dataset filters.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">3. Multi-Tier Dynamic Filter Grouping (Source &amp; Dates)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Task Description: Re-engineered the Filter By Source section to automatically render available channels as interactive button chips based on active records (is_delete = 0).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Counter Sync Enhancement: Added real-time count badges to both the &quot;All Sources&quot; option and individual source buttons. These counts now update dynamically in alignment with any applied date-range parameters.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">4. Backend Controller Optimization &amp; Aggregations</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Task Description: Rewrote the core controller aggregation logic to support the multi-layered layout.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Logic Handled: Optimized performance using Eloquent query cloning and single-collection mapping to capture status and source metrics in a single pass, significantly reducing redundant database execution load. Cleanly chained request parameters (source_id, status_tab, from_date, to_date) for accurate final data streaming.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">5. Partial Modals &amp; Asset Integration Fix</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Task Description: Resolved a system view exception caused by a missing file pointer at @include(&#039;back-end.reports.partials.modals&#039;).</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Resolution: Consolidated the underlying UI modules—specifically the Duplicate Lead Modal and the Client Behaviour Notes Modal—along with their corresponding responsive CSS overrides and target jQuery/AJAX submission scripts, directly into the primary Blade view file to ensure an isolated, error-free runtime.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented Source Lead Report to display source-wise lead counts using the lead_source field from the leads table.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed source report query logic by joining the sources table and excluding invalid/null source records.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Removed Unknown Source entries from the report and ensured only valid lead sources are displayed.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added Referred By functionality to the Lead Edit page with user-wise referral mapping support.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented conditional referral logic: existing referrals are displayed as read-only, while empty referrals can be assigned during lead editing.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Integrated referral user search functionality in the Lead Edit form using AJAX-based name, email, and mobile lookup.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed and aligned referral handling between Create Lead and Edit Lead modules to ensure consistent behavior across both forms.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '8.5', NULL, '2026-06-06 12:14:49', '2026-06-06 12:14:49'),
(494, 518, 34, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; HRMS WARRGYIZMORSCH DEVELOPMET</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 7h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added payroll record editing capability for administrators.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented &quot;Last Month&quot; filter option across applicable modules.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved dropdown design, consistency, and user experience.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Conducted testing and minor UI/UX enhancements.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Mohammad Kaif', '7', NULL, '2026-06-06 12:19:26', '2026-06-06 12:19:26'),
