(496, 520, 20, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Mewar HighTech (ERP)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented project edit history tracking with color-coded remarks for changes in project details, machines, inventory, and workflow updates.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added change log functionality to display the latest project modifications for better visibility to the Production Head.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented category-wise item selection in the Office Request Slip module.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Standardized item name formatting across the project using item details and dimensions, displaying only available values in mm format.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Enhanced Purchase Order print layout:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added supplier address section.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Improved item details table with proper borders.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Added spacing and margins between sections.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Preserved bold/highlight formatting of Terms &amp; Conditions in print view.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Redesigned PO structure with Company Details, Supplier Details, Item Details &amp; Total, Terms &amp; Conditions, and Authorized Signature sections.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Created Inhouse Machine Master migration, model, and item relationship structure for the upcoming Inhouse Request Slip module.</li><li styl