(547, 559, 53, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Other (Development)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Worked on Finance Lab website content creation and updates for multiple loan categories including Home Loan, Auto Loan, Personal Loan, Business Loan, Study Loan, Bike Loan, and Property Loan.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Created and updated loan-specific descriptions, &quot;Why Choose Us&quot; sections, key benefits, FAQs, and call-to-action content across loan pages.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed website UI sections and finalized suitable content placement for banners, sliders, footer sections, and FAQ areas.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Generated and shortlisted realistic Indian-themed images for Business Loan and Property Loan sections to improve website presentation and user engagement.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Analyzed Mewar ERP Project Module and discussed potential improvements related to project reporting, project health monitoring, worker productivity tracking, work order management, resource allocation, and project performance reporting.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Manish patidar', '8', NULL, '2026-06-09 12:40:25', '2026-06-09 12:40:25'),
