(590, 585, 6, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; AIN Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 7h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed and tested Mobile App APIs for Countries, Services, Subjects, Urgency, and Word Count dropdowns.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented User Authentication APIs including Register, Login, Forgot Password, and Reset Password using Laravel Sanctum.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Configured and tested password reset email functionality and verified reset link generation workflow.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed Place Order API with validation and database insertion for mobile app order submissions.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Integrated API authentication using Bearer Tokens and tested protected routes through Postman.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '7', NULL, '2026-06-10 12:47:47', '2026-06-10 12:47:47'),
(591, 585, 53, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Other (Development)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 1h 30m</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Analyzed and tested the Iron Streets WooCommerce category page mobile layout issues.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Identified and fixed mobile sidebar visibility problems by hiding unnecessary sections such as Categories, Filter by Price, Color Filter, Compare Products, and No Products to Compare.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed existing theme and custom CSS conflicts affecting the mobile menu, product grid, and responsive layout behavior.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented and tested mobile-specific CSS overrides to improve product category page responsiveness without impacting desktop layouts.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Investigated WooCommerce product grid structure and configured responsive adjustments to display products in a mobile-friendly single-column layout.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reviewed FAQ and USP/service icon sections and applied responsive layout improvements to display content more effectively on mobile devices.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Analyzed footer responsiveness issues and implemented mobile-specific styling recommendations for proper alignment and spacing across smaller screens.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Performed end-to-end mobile UI testing and debugging to identify theme-level CSS conflicts causing layout inconsistencies.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Rahul Sharma', '1.5', NULL, '2026-06-10 12:47:47', '2026-06-10 12:47:47'),
(592, 586, 34, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; HRMS WARRGYIZMORSCH DEVELOPMET</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Updated the Leave Balance page UI and improved monthly remaining balance calculations.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Displayed employees&#039; remaining leave balance directly on the leave application form.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed a new Technical Review module for employee evaluations.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Made Technical Review criteria and maximum points dynamic based on the selected department.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented department-wise review configuration and validation.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Mohammad Kaif', '8', NULL, '2026-06-10 12:48:16', '2026-06-10 12:48:16'),
