(612, 594, 5, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; POS System</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 2h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Researched and fixed major accounting entry issues in sales, purchases, returns, payments, expenses, and vouchers.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed GST entry issues and improved GST record matching where GST values were missing or mismatched.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Fixed Profit &amp; Loss Account and Balance Sheet calculation issues to make reports properly balanced.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Mangilal Gadri', '2', NULL, '2026-06-11 04:47:51', '2026-06-11 04:47:51'),
