(701, 644, 53, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Other (Development)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Completed R&amp;D for existing ERP modules and analyzed the current system structure.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Created an implementation plan to seamlessly resolve issues in the existing CRM, HRMS, and Inventory modules.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Identified major architectural issues, including:</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Missing tenant-wise data isolation in some database tables.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Lack of proper relationship between users and employees tables.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Data structure and integration issues affecting module scalability.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Prepared a detailed implementation approach to fix these issues while maintaining existing functionality.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Unable to proceed with implementation due to system-related issues.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Meeting with Sir.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Activity.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Jay Sahu', '8', NULL, '2026-06-13 11:39:49', '2026-06-13 11:39:49'),
