(749, 679, 33, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; Saas ERP</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Conducted detailed research on ERP architecture and business process workflows across Inventory, Purchase Requisition (PR), Purchase Order (PO), Sales, Manufacturing, and Project Management modules.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Studied end-to-end procurement flow from Material Requirement → PR →  PO → GRN → Inventory Management.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Analyzed manufacturing workflow including BOM, Production Planning, Work Orders, Shop Floor Operations, and Finished Goods management.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Explored sales process flow covering Quotation, Sales Order, Delivery, Invoicing, and Customer Management.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Researched Zoho ERP ecosystem and reviewed how Zoho Projects, Inventory, Books, CRM, and other business applications integrate to manage complete business operations.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Studied project management workflows including project creation, milestones, task management, dependencies, timesheets, reporting, and project tracking mechanisms.</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>', 'Manish patidar', '8', NULL, '2026-06-16 12:31:49', '2026-06-16 12:31:49'),
