(754, 687, 61, '\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"padding-left: 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n                <p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #1e293b;\">&bull; SAAS AI (Development)</span>\n                    <span style=\"color: #3858f9; font-weight: 700;\"> - 8h</span>\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 24px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Project – Predictive Deal Health Scoring (SaaS)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Verified live Gmail and AI integration</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Confirmed successful synchronization between Gmail data and LLM-generated deal analysis</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Validated AI-generated health scores and status predictions</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Enhanced Smart Inbox Scanner</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Added advanced email filtering by sender, unread status, keywords, and result limits</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Improved inbox processing and data extraction accuracy</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Developed and refined SaaS Dashboard</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Built and integrated a responsive web interface with backend APIs</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Improved visualization of deal insights and analytics</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Upgraded Predictive CRM features</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Enhanced AI outputs with trend analysis and recommended next actions</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Added progress indicators and summary metrics for deal health monitoring</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Implemented background automation</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">○ Configured scheduled monitoring for inactive deals</li><li st